              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Problem & Solution -->
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-text-primary font-semibold">Problem:</strong> Manual release verification for bi-weekly Oracle BRM releases involved over 100 repetitive manual CLI steps to calculate and verify checksums across billing packages, leading to operational toil and risk of human error.
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-text-primary font-semibold">Solution:</strong> Engineered parallelized shell scripts utilizing time-based filtering and background jobs to automate checksum operations and artifact integrity verification across distributed environments.
              </div>
