                  <span>Parallelized background workers executing concurrent checksum validations</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-accent">›</span>
                  <span>Time-based filtering mechanism targeting exact release packages automatically</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-accent">›</span>
                  <span>Eliminated 100+ manual CLI steps per release cycle while reducing error risk</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-accent">›</span>
                  <span>Standardized operational procedure adopted across engineering operations</span>
